  "updated_at": "2026-04-14",
  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Denver, Tiny Tempest Tattoo is an intimate sanctuary for body art enthusiasts seeking the fluidity and vibrance of watercolor tattoos. This exclusive, one-artist studio thrives on personal appointments to craft bespoke masterpieces, inspired by the dramatic essence of Shakespeare's \"The Tempest,\" where the passion of artistry unleashes with every ink stroke.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Denver, Colorado, United States"
}